        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "5 months ago",
        "text": "Excellent school...especially when it comes to care and love and grace and academics......it's a great place...for kids...",
        "time": 1757617557,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Pascale Armstrong",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/109295809216095887188/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjVaKEI1WIk5XgXBDu35BPs3ywqbthk2JbUB_Irgbspv4f3jA8w4=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "2 years ago",
        "text": "Excellent, caring school! The staff genuinely care about their students and have their best interests in mind. They really try to help their students all while maintaining high academic standards. With limited resources, they do amazing things! For those ex-students who gave negative reviews it just reflects the kind of student they were, despite the teachers offering lots of help throughout their time at the school. You can't please everyone, no matter how hard you try. Everyone is given a chance. Your attitude and willingness to work will determine your level of success. Those who want to learn will be given every chance at FCA. My 2 children went to this school and I taught there as well and I wouldn't change a thing! Highly recommend this amazing school!",
        "time": 1693315310,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Ria",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/114800662403112365252/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjVT_7nLgB_XnqQ6yxgTega23Ti0z5YZlEbqvEG2M6hNMQy5oUnf=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "a year ago",
        "text": "Great caring teachers! I’m glad my parents decided on fca. They helped me with my French and Math, now I’m in university very greatful to have been taught by Mrs.Hanson and all the other teachers here at fca. If it weren’t for fca I wouldn’t be at the University of Toronto studying what I love. For any parents in doubt, this is the best decision you can make for your child. Everyone’s nice and it’s was easy to make friends compared to other schools. No other school in Montreal can even come close compared to FCA. ✝️",
        "time": 1732067842,
        "translated": false
      },
